WEBVTT

1
00:00:06.500 --> 00:00:10.500
Three drops. By morning, truth go come
out.

2
00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:17.500
Mama cook am for you herself! Pepper soup
special!

3
00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:23.500
Since when Mama dey cook for me?

4
00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:29.000
Drink am, my daughter. E good for belle.

5
00:00:29.500 --> 00:00:31.200
Oya now.

6
00:00:35.500 --> 00:00:38.500
Wait… wetin be this?

7
00:00:43.000 --> 00:00:46.500
Jesus! Mama, wetin you put inside this
soup?!

8
00:00:49.500 --> 00:00:53.500
Na anointing! Anointing dey bitter small!

9
00:00:57.000 --> 00:01:00.000
Ehn ehn! Wahala don land!

10
00:01:00.500 --> 00:01:02.200
Olorun mi!

11
00:01:05.000 --> 00:01:08.500
Ada… I no like this one at all.

12
00:01:08.800 --> 00:01:10.200
Show me.

13
00:01:15.500 --> 00:01:18.800
Mama, you first. Na you cook am.

14
00:01:22.500 --> 00:01:26.500
Na that day I know say… the soup no be for
me alone.
